e of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Colquitt County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. October to November is the driest pair at 5.11 inches of normal and came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 24% of normal in September to October and 30% in October to November. All 6 grids had their driest year in 1954, with grid 13686 at 51%.</p>"}
